{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0838E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"健康管理也是特工的重要工作，可我一时大意，竟然感冒了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"仔细想想，Mother Base的人口一直在增加，士兵们来自各地，也都是因为各种原因聚到这里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"无论何时从什么地方带进未知病毒，都不足为奇。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过，我感染的只是普通感冒。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"医疗班诊断说卧床几天就会好，于是我只能一直躺在自己房间的床上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我本以为自己已经习惯了身边没有真正理解我的人……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可这种时候，还是会觉得孤身一人很可悲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我只能抚摸Nuke的背，借此排解难受。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"Nuke默默地待在我身边。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过在我卧床期间，Amanda、Chico、Huey、Cécile、Miller，还有几个和我比较亲近的士兵，都来看望过我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":133,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Amanda给我做了加有药草的汤，说是对感冒有效。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"Miller说“现在好好休息。我给你唱首摇篮曲”，还带来吉他，唱了一首我完全听不懂的日语歌。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"虽然听不懂歌词，但他唱得有多难听，我倒是听得很清楚。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"之后他又说“感冒就得用栓剂！我给你示范……”还想脱裤子，我便抓起旁边的纸巾盒砸过去，把他赶了出去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"接着Strangelove也来了，说是有一种很好的印度药。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"她说“里面含有桉树叶提取物，涂在胸口很有效”——说着就想脱掉我的运动服。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"我当然用枕头狠狠砸了她一顿，把她赶了出去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"Chico拿来一朵插在杯子里的小花。似乎是从不知附着在什么东西上、被带进Mother Base的那一点点泥土里自己长出来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":154,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"他装作若无其事地说“这个是在甲板上找到的，送你”，不过看来Chico好像喜欢我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"他们并不是能理解我的人。即使有人来看望我，我也无法坦率地为此高兴。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"到了晚上，就连Snake也来到了我的房间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"面对这个相信我只是普通女学生、还为我操心的男人，我试着问了他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"为什么要抛弃自己的国家？为什么要组建MSF？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"当然，我早就知道答案。可我还是想至少亲耳听他说一次。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"和我想的一样，他没有多说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"他只说，因为自己除了战斗什么都不会，所以被国家抛弃了。可也正因为除了战斗什么都不会，他才需要MSF。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"然后他说：“我只懂战斗。但我也不想否定那些相信和平的人。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"我同样不相信什么和平。斗争才是人类的本质。要想活下去，就必须打倒敌人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"或许，我们其实是同一类人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"但也正因为如此，最终我大概会杀了他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"又或者，是我被他杀掉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"一想到还要继续这样糟糕透顶的人生，我甚至觉得，死在这个男人手里也不坏。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""}]}